O('nfsa','National Food Safety Authority','NFSA','REG',['c14','c7'],'EG','Cairo, Egypt',2017,'nfsa.gov.eg','Egyptian authority established by Law 1 of 2017 for food-safety regulation: inspection and clearance of imported and exported food products, sampling and testing, issue of safety approvals. Check current mandate for grain and feed at source.',{com:['wheat','corn','soy','meal','oil','sun','barley','rice'],rel:['capq','goeic','customs_eg','nafeza'],ar:'الهيئة القومية لسلامة الغذاء',docs:['Importing/exporting procedures and fees published on the NFSA website (verify current).'],guide:'Before arrival: confirm food-safety requirements for the cargo, register the importer and the cargo through the clearance system, and arrange sampling and testing on discharge. Hold: do not move cargo from the port before required clearance.'});
O('capq','Central Administration of Plant Quarantine','CAPQ','REG',['c14','c7'],'EG','Giza, Egypt','','agri.gov.eg','Egypt\'s National Plant Protection Organization within the Ministry of Agriculture and Land Reclamation. Issues import permits and conducts phytosanitary inspection of imported plant commodities; sets pest-related import conditions (for example on wheat and soybeans).',{com:['wheat','corn','soy','barley','rice','sun'],rel:['ippc','nfsa','customs_eg'],ar:'الإدارة المركزية للحجر الزراعي',guide:'Check CAPQ import conditions for the commodity and origin (e.g. phytosanitary certificate content, fumigation, additional declarations) before contracting. Phytosanitary certificate from the origin NPPO is typically required. Verify the current requirement at source.',note:'Official domain unverified; see link check. Ministry website may be moa.gov.eg or agri.gov.eg.'});
O('goeic','General Organization for Export and Import Control','GOEIC','REG',['c14'],'EG','Cairo, Egypt','','goeic.gov.eg','Egyptian organisation under the Ministry of Trade and Industry for quality control of imported and exported goods; inspection of goods and registration of factories/exporters to Egypt (verify scope per commodity at source).',{com:ALLC,rel:['mti','nafeza','customs_eg','nfsa'],ar:'الهيئة العامة للرقابة على الصادرات والواردات'});
O('customs_eg','Egyptian Customs Authority','ECA','GOV',['c14','c6'],'EG','Cairo, Egypt','','customs.gov.eg','Collects customs duties and clears imports: tariff, valuation, release procedures; Advance Cargo Information (ACI) system for sea cargo operates through the Nafeza platform.',{com:ALLC,rel:['nafeza','cargox','goeic','nfsa','mof'],ar:'مصلحة الجمارك المصرية',guide:'ACI registration of the importer and the shipment before the vessel loads is required for sea cargo under the Egyptian ACI regime. Confirm the current rules at the Customs/Nafeza sites. Customs valuation and HS classification determine duties; check Egypt\'s current tariff.'});
O('mts','Ministry of Supply and Internal Trade','MoSIT','GOV',['c14'],'EG','Cairo, Egypt','','mts.gov.eg','Egyptian ministry responsible for staple food supply (subsidised bread/wheat flour), strategic stocks and food subsidy programmes.',{com:['wheat','rice','oil'],rel:['gasc','mostakbal'],ar:'وزارة التموين والتجارة الداخلية'});
O('gasc','General Authority for Supply Commodities (GASC)','GASC','GOV',['c14'],'EG','Cairo, Egypt','','gasc.gov.eg','Historic Egyptian state buyer of wheat, edible oils and other strategic commodities via public tenders. Role in wheat imports changed in recent years; check the current buyer and procurement route at official sources.',{com:['wheat','oil','rice'],rel:['mts','mostakbal'],ar:'الهيئة العامة للسلع التموينية',note:'Status and domain to be verified; the state procurement structure has changed. Do not assume GASC tenders are current.'});
